<section class="location-map">
    <h2>Visit Us</h2>
    <div
        style="background: var(--gray-100); border: 2px solid var(--primary-black); padding: 2rem; text-align: center;">
        <h3>Utopia City Hall</h3>
        <p>1234 Government Plaza<br>
            Utopia City, UC 12345</p>

        <div
            style="margin: 2rem 0; padding: 2rem; background: var(--checkered-pattern); border: 1px solid var(--gray-400);">
            <p><strong>Interactive Map Coming Soon</strong></p>
            <p>Detailed directions and parking information will be available in our upcoming map feature.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="cards" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
            <div class="card">
                <h4>Parking</h4>
                <p>Free public parking available in the Government Plaza parking garage. Enter from Main Street.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h4>Public Transit</h4>
                <p>Bus routes 5, 12, and 18 stop directly at City Hall. Metro station is 2 blocks away.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h4>Accessibility</h4>
                <p>Full ADA compliance with wheelchair access, elevators, and assistance available upon request.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<div style="margin: 2rem 0; padding: 1rem; background: var(--gray-100); border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-black);">
    <p><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> For faster service, please include as much detail as possible in your message. This
        helps us route your inquiry to the right department and respond more effectively.</p>
</div>
